escaped by default: &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;
the safe filter turns it off: <script>alert(1)</script>
mark_safe marks the value, not the template: <em>ok</em>
autoescape block: <script>alert(1)</script>
status: 200
body: <li>desk: 100</li><li>lamp: 20</li>
the negative line never reached the template: True
